@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowColor #C62828
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C62828
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title Edit a student's group labels
participant "Edit command" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "Pending model" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Command : Edit student's labels
activate Command

Command -> Model : Read all students
Model --> Command : Student records
Command -> Command : Find student by ID
Command -> Command : Remove tutorial 1 and add tutorial 2
note over Command
Keep the Student ID, attendance,
and fields not supplied in the command.
end note
Command -> Model : Replace the student's record
Command -> Model : Show the full student list

[<-- Command : Edit result
deactivate Command
@enduml
